{"id":485,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"学び続ける生徒を育む神大附属教育","feature_description":"神奈川大学附属中・高等学校は、『自ら考え、判断し、行動できる人』を育てることを掲げ、学習・部活動・特別活動を三位一体で捉えています。6年間の学習や各教科の歩みを通して、確かな学力と創造性、豊かな人間性を伸ばすのが特徴です。部活動紹介でも、週4日までの活動や指導体制を示し、学習との両立を意識した学校生活を整えています。受験生向けの案内も多く、学校像をつかみやすい構成です。","clubs":[{"id":9631,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fhs.kanagawa-u.ac.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9632,"name":"軟式野球部（中学）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fhs.kanagawa-u.ac.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9633,"name":"硬式野球部（高校）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fhs.kanagawa-u.ac.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9634,"name":"水球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fhs.kanagawa-u.ac.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9635,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fhs.kanagawa-u.ac.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9636,"name":"硬式庭球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fhs.kanagawa-u.ac.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9637,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fhs.kanagawa-u.ac.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9638,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fhs.kanagawa-u.ac.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9639,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fhs.kanagawa-u.ac.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9640,"name":"なぎなた部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fhs.kanagawa-u.ac.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9641,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fhs.kanagawa-u.ac.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9642,"name":"囲碁・将棋部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.fhs.kanagawa-u.ac.jp/life/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9643,"name":"技術家庭科部","category":"文化部","source_url